  "name": "Garlic Butter",
  "text": "Garlic Butter\n\nPreparation time: 5 minutes\n\nCooking time: none\n\nIngredients\n\n250 g unsalted butter,\n\n3 large cloves of garlic (finely chopped),\n\n30 g chopped shallot,\n\n50 g chopped parsley,\n\n1-2 tsp salt,\n\nfreshly ground black pepper.\n\nPreparation\n\n1. Cream the butter.\n\n2. Mix the ingredients.",
